SUMMARY:Torah: Genesis 1:27
DESCRIPTION:וַיִּבְרָא אֱלֹהִים אֶת־הָאָדָם 
 בְּצַלְמוֹ בְּצֶלֶם אֱלֹהִים בָּרָא אֹת
 וֹ זָכָר וּנְקֵבָה בָּרָא אֹתָם׃\nVayivra Eloh
 im et-ha'adam betzalmo betzelem Elohim bara oto zakhar unekevah bara otam\
 nAnd God created man in His own image\, in the image of God created He him
 \; male and female created He them.\n\nEvery person is made in the image o
 f God. That is why each human life has worth\, whoever the person is and w
 herever they come from.\n\nOpen Aleph: https://alef-review.onrender.com/#/
 morning
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CATEGORIES:Aleph
END:VEVENT
